// EXTENDING THIS MODULE (a later worker adds the app-surface scenes):
// add one export per scene below, keeping the EXACT format —
// Buffer.from( 'chunk' + 'chunk' + 'lastchunk', 'base64', ) with
// string CONCATENATION (' +' line endings, 100-char chunks, last chunk
// ends with ','). NEVER comma-separate the chunks: Node would read
// chunk #2 as an encoding and the whole API crashes at import
// (ERR_UNKNOWN_ENCODING). Always verify by IMPORTING this module in
// node and MD5-checking every export against its source .webp file —
// `node --check` does NOT catch the broken form.

